2026-09-17 01:09:07,513 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "a089e309-938a-49c6-86a7-f090ba84d3e2", "created_at": "2026-09-16T23:09:07.380268", "failure_effects": ["M\u00f6tet lyckas inte l\u00e5sa V:s toleransroll: V kvarst\u00e5r vid krav p\u00e5 starkt synligt inflytande eller regeringsdeltagande, och C:s r\u00f6da linje mot V-inflytande f\u00f6rblir of\u00f6renlig med V:s krav.", "S+C+MP-paketet konsolideras inte; budgetramen spricker p\u00e5 of\u00f6renliga krav (V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/bostadskrav mot C:s och MP:s budgetlinjer), och den S-ledda statsministerv\u00e4gen f\u00f6rblir \u00f6ppen utan s\u00e4krad majoritet."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.35, "rationale": "S can feasibly convene the meetings and bind itself to a cooperation framework, but the Desired Effect's core components\u2014V's formal acceptance of a tolerance role, C's and MP's consolidation of a budget framework, and a credible 176-mandate path\u2014are commitments of other Actors. No authoritative Effect establishes prior acceptance; the pros' claims are contested by the cons, and the hidden information shows genuine conflicts (V requires strong visible influence or government participation, C has a high credibility cost for V involvement, MP needs concrete climate wins while V presses welfare/housing demands). The action is a reasonable next step, and the hidden information suggests some flexibility on all sides, so success is possible but not likely within 48 hours. The full consolidation therefore carries residual causal uncertainty, adjudicated probabilistically.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["M\u00f6tet lyckas inte l\u00e5sa V:s toleransroll: V kvarst\u00e5r vid krav p\u00e5 starkt synligt inflytande eller regeringsdeltagande, och C:s r\u00f6da linje mot V-inflytande f\u00f6rblir of\u00f6renlig med V:s krav.", "S+C+MP-paketet konsolideras inte; budgetramen spricker p\u00e5 of\u00f6renliga krav (V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/bos