2026-09-17 01:09:34,210 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:09:34.101928", "id": "ff161889-1fb9-49d4-97f2-11ee47489f1e", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd", "l"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "SD has now definitively refused any tolerance role: it demands to be in government or opposition, not a support party, and will vote no to a narrower M-led government. This closes both M-led paths. The realistic outcome is an S+C+MP government with V tolerance. I intend to accept this and lead a disciplined opposition that keeps the Tid\u00f6 bloc (M, SD, KD, L) together as a coherent alternative. I ask you both to hold with us and not drift to the S-mitten. We preserve our relationships and credibility for the future.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 01:09:34,210 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:09:34.113140", "id": "06c91dfe-ac15-4d94-8e46-9fad42123849", "public": false, "recipients": ["sd"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "I accept your position. We will not ask you to tolerate. I will keep the Tid\u00f6 bloc together as a coherent opposition and will not abandon you. Let's stay in close contact \u2014 we remain natural partners, and I will not burn this bridge.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 01:09:34,210 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:09:34.121930", "id": "2c086694-54a2-4220-b5d7-d59ba41057bc", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "Moderaterna accepts the parliamentary reality. With the current positions, an S-led government is the realistic outcome. We will not obstruct its formation, but we will lead a strong, disciplined opposition that keeps the Tid\u00f6 bloc together and presents a coherent alternative on budget and policy.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 01:09:34,210 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Moderaterna publicly accepts the parliamentary reality that an S-led government is the realistic outcome and commits to leading a disciplined opposition that keeps the Tid\u00f6 bloc (M, SD, KD, L) together as a coherent alternative, without obstructing the S-led government's formation.", "actor_id": "m", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "M is established as the leading, credible opposition voice that preserves the Tid\u00f6 bloc and its relationships for the future, while the S-led government is allowed to form without M bearing blame for obstruction.", "id": "0a6382ad-9a44-4360-a821-db705e25b866", "pros": ["Both M-led paths are definitively closed (C refuses SD in government; SD definitively refuses a tolerance role), so the PM post is unattainable; a graceful, principled pivot preserves M's credibility rather than a futile fight.", "Keeping the Tid\u00f6 bloc (173 seats) together gives M a strong, coherent base for future elections and negotiations, and prevents C and KD from drifting further to the S-mitten.", "Not obstructing the S-led path avoids M being cast as obstructionist and preserves future cooperation options with C and KD.", "Leading the opposition on budget and policy keeps M relevant and influential throughout the S-led term, positioning M for the next election."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
