2026-09-17 01:12:47,300 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:12:47.194658", "id": "422216b4-64f8-408e-bcc7-9e83089d1d0e", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "SD rejects the premature concession of the statsministerpost to S. The Tid\u00f6 four \u2014 an M-led government with SD, KD and L \u2014 remains the only stable right-wing alternative, and SD's 62 mandates are decisive: without SD no right-wing government can form. The S-led path is not secure: the budget frame has already cracked, V's demand for influence is incompatible with C's and MP's lines, and V could defect and vote NO, which would give 202 NO against an S-led candidate. SD will not accept being relegated to opposition while its parliamentary weight is taken for granted. We call on M not to surrender the PM prematurely and on M, KD and L to keep the Tid\u00f6 bloc together.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 01:12:47,300 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:12:47.206963", "id": "3d5ba481-6c5a-4ae5-8269-7ca75bdb192e", "public": false, "recipients": ["m"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "Your public concession to an S-led government is premature and rests on a false premise. The S+C+MP+V path is not consolidated: the budget frame has already cracked, V's influence demand clashes with C's and MP's lines, and V could defect and vote NO, giving 202 NO against an S-led candidate. Do not surrender the PM. Keep the Tid\u00f6 four alive with you as PM and SD in government. We need you to pressure C to tolerate the Tid\u00f6 four. If you abandon the bloc, SD will go to clear opposition and vote NO against any narrower M-led attempt.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 01:12:47,300 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-16T23:12:47.215402", "id": "66ebe15c-65f3-42c4-9f12-26bc6021a2a9", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd", "l"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "Keep the Tid\u00f6 bloc together \u2014 do not drift toward the S-mitten. The Tid\u00f6 four is the only stable right-wing government, and SD's 62 mandates are decisive. M's concession to S is premature: the S-led path is fragile and unconsolidated. Stand with us to keep the Tid\u00f6 four alive with SD in government.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 01:12:47,300 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "SD publicly and privately rejects M's premature concession of the statsministerpost to S, reaffirms that the Tid\u00f6 four (an M-led government with SD, KD and L) remains the only stable right-wing option, and demands that M not surrender the PM and that M/KD/L pressure C to tolerate SD in government; SD warns that if the Tid\u00f6 four is abandoned it will go to clear opposition and vote NO against any narrower M-led attempt.", "actor_id": "sd", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Tid\u00f6 four option remains alive and M's concession is not treated as final; the S-led path (S+C+MP+V) is exposed as fragile and unconsolidated, keeping SD's 62 decisive mandates as the pivotal factor in any government formation.", "id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "pros": ["Tid\u00f6 four = 173 is the only right-wing majority and requires SD; without SD no right-wing government can form, so SD's weight cannot be taken for granted.", "The S-led path (S+C+MP+V = 176) is unconsolidated: the budget frame already cracked on incompatible demands, and V's influence demand clashes with C's and MP's lines.", "V could defect and vote NO against an S-led candidate, producing 202 NO and killing the S-led path, so M's concession rests on a false premise.", "M's public concession is premature and would lock SD out of government while taking its decisive mandates for granted.", "SD's clear stance keeps pressure on M/KD/L to deliver C or face SD in clear opposition, preserving SD's leverage."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
