2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "c", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "04c6aa45-aca7-4af9-85be-bfe6d97cb26f", "reason": "SD:s Tid\u00f6fyra (173) kan inte passera 175-nejtestet eftersom C, S, V och MP (176) r\u00f6star nej, och C:s r\u00f6da linje mot SD i regering \u00e4r fast och offentlig; SD:s hot att g\u00e5 till 'klar opposition' om Tid\u00f6 \u00f6verges \u00e4r sj\u00e4lvdestruktivt eftersom det skulle ta bort SD:s egen avg\u00f6rande h\u00e4vst\u00e5ng och kollapsa h\u00f6gerblocket helt, s\u00e5 Tid\u00f6alternativet kan inte h\u00e5llas vid liv utan C-tolerans som SD saknar v\u00e4g att s\u00e4kra. Den S-ledda v\u00e4gen \u00e4r inte s\u00e5 sk\u00f6r som SD h\u00e4vdar: S, C, MP och V har alla bekr\u00e4ftat S+C+MP-underlaget med V-tolerans utifr\u00e5n, och budgetramens spricka \u00e4r en l\u00f6sbar f\u00f6rhandlingspunkt, inte en strukturell of\u00f6renlighet."}
2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "0ec463a0-46f1-4fd1-860b-8087f691bea7", "reason": "SD:s premiss att Tid\u00f6fyran \u00e4r det enda stabila h\u00f6geralternativet \u00e4r felaktig: C v\u00e4grar kategoriskt SD i regering och SD har gett ett slutgiltigt nej till tolerans, s\u00e5 fyran kan inte bildas oavsett M:s h\u00e5llning. SD:s krav att pressa C att tolerera SD i regering \u00e4r d\u00e4rf\u00f6r utsiktsl\u00f6st och skulle bara f\u00f6rl\u00e4nga l\u00e5sningen, medan SD:s p\u00e5st\u00e5ende att V skulle desertera och r\u00f6sta nej mot en S-ledd kandidat \u00e4r spekulativt \u2014 V \u00e4r \u00f6ppen f\u00f6r formf\u00f6rhandling och vill ha inflytande, s\u00e5 det kan lika g\u00e4rna st\u00f6dja en S-ledd regering."}
2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "m", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "285aa6e3-a6f9-4cc4-8a7d-671e34fbac7b", "reason": "The Tid\u00f6 four cannot be revived regardless of M's concession: C has a firm, unchanged red line against tolerating SD in government, so the four-party option (173) cannot reach the required majority even if M pressures C; and SD's own definitive refusal of a tolerance role closes the narrower M-led fallback. Even if the S-led path collapses on V's demands, the Tid\u00f6 four still cannot form, so keeping it 'alive' is not a viable route to an M-led government."}
2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "v", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "42c3f5b6-eaeb-470e-bcb1-9c94f9b69621", "reason": "SD's desired effect rests on a false premise: it claims V could defect and vote NO against an S-led candidate, but V is actively negotiating a binding cooperation structure with S and supports the S-led path, so V will not vote NO. Moreover, C has confirmed it will vote NO against any Tid\u00f6 government, so the Tid\u00f6 four (M+SD+KD+L=173) cannot form regardless of SD's demands, and M has already publicly accepted the S-led outcome and committed to disciplined opposition. SD's attempt to keep the Tid\u00f6 option alive and expose the S-led path as fragile therefore cannot succeed."}
2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "s", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "54d2147e-5217-4941-9f39-8e5d3f0777cd", "reason": "M:s offentliga accepterande av en S-ledd regering och \u00e5tagandet om disciplinerad opposition \u00e4r redan fast och offentligt; Tid\u00f6blocket (173) kan \u00e4nd\u00e5 inte blockera en S-ledd statsminister (kr\u00e4ver 175), s\u00e5 SD:s krav att M inte ska l\u00e4mna ifr\u00e5n sig statsministerposten kan inte \u00e5teruppliva Tid\u00f6-v\u00e4gen utan att M f\u00f6rlorar trov\u00e4rdighet. SD:s hot om att g\u00e5 i tydlig opposition skulle dessutom sj\u00e4lv spr\u00e4cka det Tid\u00f6block SD s\u00e4ger sig f\u00f6rsvara, och p\u00e5st\u00e5endet att V skulle defektera och ge 202 NO \u00e4r spekulativt n\u00e4r V redan accepterat strukturen f\u00f6r ett bindande samarbetsavtal."}
2026-09-17 01:17:59,308 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "mp", "argument_id": "bc4d8cd6-155d-4e97-826f-ba50ad53f1c2", "id": "6e066477-4738-44ba-8ed3-ced7714824ac", "reason": "SD's demand that M/KD/L pressure C to tolerate SD in government is futile: C (25 seats) has firmly committed to voting NO against any Tid\u00f6 government including SD, and without C's tolerance the Tid\u00f6 four (173) cannot reach the 175 threshold. Moreover M has already publicly committed to the S-led outcome and disciplined opposition, so reversing that concession would destroy M's credibility as opposition leader. The Tid\u00f6 four is therefore not a viable government option regardless of SD's leverage, and SD's 62 mandates cannot be made pivotal for a right-wing government that cannot form."}
