2026-09-17 02:32:28,437 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:32:28.322713", "id": "14d17f0b-ca32-434b-aa4e-0467f24de098", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Centerpartiet, vi bekr\u00e4ftar att vi accepterar den gemensamma r\u00f6dgr\u00f6na kravlistan (V+MP) som f\u00f6rhandlingsgrund f\u00f6r det bindande paketet, och vi kallar nu samman arbetsgruppen (C+S+MP) skyndsamt f\u00f6r att f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4lla reform- och budgetpaketet med en gemensam finanspolitisk ram som V kan tolerera. Vi \u00e4r beredda att arbeta konstruktivt f\u00f6r att f\u00f6rena era liberala reformkrav (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, liberal ekonomi, skola) med V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds- och j\u00e4mlikhetskrav och MP:s klimatkrav i en sammanh\u00e5llen ram. F\u00f6r att statsministeromr\u00f6stningen ska vara s\u00e4krad ber vi er formellt bekr\u00e4fta er uttryckliga r\u00f6stposition (JA eller AVST\u00c5R) f\u00f6r v\u00e5r statsministerkandidat, ut\u00f6ver ert redan bekr\u00e4ftade icke-nej.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:32:28,437 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:32:28.335982", "id": "8eba80b9-4bfc-46f5-a4aa-51580f152267", "public": false, "recipients": ["v", "mp"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Tack f\u00f6r den gemensamma r\u00f6dgr\u00f6na kravlistan. Vi accepterar den som f\u00f6rhandlingsgrund f\u00f6r det bindande regeringspaketet och vill presentera den tillsammans med er och C. Vi kallar nu samman arbetsgruppen (C+S+MP) skyndsamt f\u00f6r att konkretisera bindande, verifierbara \u00e5taganden inom v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet, minskad vinstjakt samt klimat och milj\u00f6, och f\u00f6r att fastst\u00e4lla en gemensamt accepterad finanspolitisk ram och trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g. Vi r\u00e4knar med er tolerans (AVST\u00c5R) och ert budgetst\u00f6d (S+C+V+MP=176) p\u00e5 denna grund.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:32:28,438 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Socialdemokraterna convenes the C+S+MP working group immediately to finalize a binding, verifiable reform- and budget package (reconciling C's liberal-economy/school/decentralization demands, MP's binding climate commitments, and V's welfare/housing/equality demands within one financial framework), accepts the V+MP red-green demand list as the negotiation basis, and secures C's explicit JA/AVSTAR vote position for the S PM candidate.", "actor_id": "s", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A credible, binding S-led government package (S-C-MP with V as tolerance outside) is finalized with all partners' explicit vote positions confirmed, so the PM vote passes (C non-NEJ, Tido=173<175) and the budget has a majority (S+C+V+MP=176), keeping SD out of government.", "id": "7c4fe596-130b-4747-80e3-ddb19e38df2a", "pros": ["All three partners (C, MP, V) have already confirmed their roles and vote positions, so the working group can finalize rather than renegotiate.", "A single binding financial framework reconciles C's liberal-economy demands with V's welfare/equality demands and MP's climate demands, preventing incompatible multi-party demands.", "C's explicit JA/AVSTAR confirmation removes the last uncertainty for the PM vote, which passes if C does not vote NEJ.", "V's tolerance and budget support (176) are secured only by concrete verifiable commitments, which the working group now delivers.", "Convening now locks in the S-C-MP+V structure before Tido can consolidate, keeping SD out of government."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
