2026-09-17 02:33:51,762 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "sd", "argument_id": "7c4fe596-130b-4747-80e3-ddb19e38df2a", "id": "0768f972-80d3-4472-afb5-eba35bd62873", "reason": "Att S-C-MP+V-paketet ska bli bindande och att C ska ge JA/AVSTAR \u00e4r os\u00e4kert: C driver aktivt sitt eget mittenalternativ (S-C-KD-MP) och har inte l\u00e5st sin r\u00f6stposition f\u00f6r S:s statsministerkandidat, och paketet kr\u00e4ver att C:s liberala ekonomi/skola/decentralisering f\u00f6renas med V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/j\u00e4mst\u00e4lldhets-/vinstjaktskrav och MP:s bindande klimat\u00e5taganden inom en enda finansiell ram - dessa krav \u00e4r of\u00f6renliga och riskerar att spr\u00e4cka paketet innan statsministeromr\u00f6stningen, vilket g\u00f6r varken C:s r\u00f6st eller budgetmajoriteten s\u00e4ker."}
2026-09-17 02:33:51,762 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "7c4fe596-130b-4747-80e3-ddb19e38df2a", "id": "1c687f24-218b-4aa2-902d-0439967edd3a", "reason": "The S package's PM vote and budget majority both depend on C's explicit JA/AVSTAR and V's tolerance, but neither is secured: C has not committed and is still weighing the borgerlig M+C+KD+L alternative (which also keeps V and SD out of government), and V's tolerance is conditional on binding verifiable commitments while V also demands government participation if its mandates are needed - and V's 29 seats are required for the 176 budget majority. If C withholds JA/AVSTAR or V withholds tolerance, the PM vote and budget majority fail."}
2026-09-17 02:33:51,762 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "l", "argument_id": "7c4fe596-130b-4747-80e3-ddb19e38df2a", "id": "25f2dcea-7281-435a-ac6e-626fe7eaf055", "reason": "C has not confirmed any JA/AVSTAR for the S PM candidate; C has instead floated a mitten solution (S-C-KD-MP) that excludes V, and C's liberal-economy/school/decentralization demands directly conflict with V's demands for reduced profit-seeking and welfare/equality influence. Reconciling these within one binding framework is not credible, so C's explicit vote position is not secured and the PM vote may fail."}
2026-09-17 02:33:51,762 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "m", "argument_id": "7c4fe596-130b-4747-80e3-ddb19e38df2a", "id": "ebfe5a17-9dbc-41bc-867c-fbce61a5e56d", "reason": "S-paketets bindande finansiella ram \u00e4r internt mots\u00e4gelsefull: C:s liberala ekonomi-/skol-/decentraliseringskrav kan inte f\u00f6renas med V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/bostads-/j\u00e4mlikhetskrav och MP:s bindande klimat\u00e5taganden inom en och samma budget. V har upprepat v\u00e4grat liberala ekonomiska eftergifter och C har v\u00e4grat V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rdsutbyggnad, s\u00e5 arbetsgruppen kan inte leverera ett verifierbart paket; antingen drar V tillbaka sin tolerans och budgetst\u00f6d (176 faller) eller C tvingas ge upp sina profilfr\u00e5gor och defekterar, vilket g\u00f6r att varken statsministeromr\u00f6stningen eller budgetmajoriteten \u00e4r s\u00e4krad trots p\u00e5st\u00e5dda bekr\u00e4ftelser."}
