2026-09-17 02:49:05,683 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:49:05.497892", "id": "8697b374-75d0-43e5-b688-d4fca505e737", "public": false, "recipients": ["s"], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "Centerpartiet bekr\u00e4ftar h\u00e4rmed ett uttryckligt JA f\u00f6r er statsministerkandidat i en S+C+MP-regering med V som toleransparti utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Detta f\u00f6ruts\u00e4tter att arbetsgruppen (C+S+MP) f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4ller ett konkret, verifierbart reform- och budgetpaket som balanserar v\u00e5ra liberala prioriteringar (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, liberal ekonomi, klimat, skola) mot V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds- och j\u00e4mlikhetskrav och MP:s klimat\u00e5taganden inom en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram. Vi accepterar den r\u00f6dgr\u00f6na kravlistan som f\u00f6rhandlingsgrund med detta balansvillkor. L\u00e5t oss skyndsamt slutf\u00f6ra paketet s\u00e5 att statsministeromr\u00f6stningen och budgetmajoriteten s\u00e4kras.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:49:05,683 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:49:05.510703", "id": "1db33889-4e0e-47da-a360-9ba3f5640d1e", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar v\u00e5rt st\u00f6d f\u00f6r en trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g som inkluderar ert budgetst\u00f6d och bindande reform\u00e5taganden, och vi vill bygga ett paket med reellt genomslag, inte ett symboliskt avtal. Samtidigt m\u00e5ste paketet balansera era krav mot v\u00e5ra liberala prioriteringar kring f\u00f6retagande och liberal ekonomi. Vi \u00e4r redo att konkretisera detta i arbetsgruppen tillsammans med S och MP, och vi ber er bekr\u00e4fta er tolerans (avst\u00e5r, inte nej) f\u00f6r S:s statsministerkandidat n\u00e4r paketet \u00e4r p\u00e5 plats.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:49:05,683 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:49:05.519729", "id": "cb975b7c-d937-4bbe-828b-37396d69c7b2", "public": false, "recipients": ["mp"], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar v\u00e5rt JA f\u00f6r S:s statsministerkandidat och v\u00e5rt deltagande i S+C+MP-regeringen med V som toleransparti utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Vi accepterar den r\u00f6dgr\u00f6na kravlistan som f\u00f6rhandlingsgrund, med villkoret att paketet balanserar v\u00e5ra liberala prioriteringar mot era och V:s krav. L\u00e5t oss tillsammans med S skyndsamt f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4lla bindande, verifierbara klimat- och milj\u00f6\u00e5taganden och en trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g i arbetsgruppen.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:49:05,683 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "C confirms an explicit JA vote for S's PM candidate in an S+C+MP government with V as tolerance party outside government, conditional on the joint working group finalizing a concrete, verifiable reform/budget package that balances C's liberal priorities (enterprise, decentralisation, climate, liberal economy, school) against V's welfare/equality demands and MP's climate commitments within a credible fiscal framework.", "actor_id": "c", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A stable S+C+MP government with V as tolerance party is established and passes the PM vote and budget, keeping both V and SD out of government while securing C concrete, verifiable reform influence.", "id": "ab263087-0b09-4728-a8a2-7f27d0242f6f", "pros": ["Mandate math: S+C+MP+V gives a NO side of 173 < 175, so the PM vote and budget pass without KD.", "Matches C's stated mitten preference and keeps both V and SD out of government, preserving C's credibility.", "Gives C a seat in government with verifiable reform influence rather than responsibility without exchange.", "V's tolerance on a credible budget path with binding reform commitments secures the budget majority.", "MP supports this configuration with V as tolerance party, and S has accepted the red-green list as negotiation basis."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
