2026-09-17 02:51:06,054 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "m", "argument_id": "ab263087-0b09-4728-a8a2-7f27d0242f6f", "id": "098afd00-1da4-40ad-bc48-030c1bbe5e74", "reason": "C:s villkorade JA f\u00f6r S+C+MP+V bygger p\u00e5 att arbetsgruppen f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4ller ett konkret, verifierbart paket, men arbetsgruppen har redan misslyckats att f\u00f6rena C:s liberala ekonomi/skola/decentralisering med V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd/j\u00e4mlikhet och MP:s bindande klimat\u00e5taganden inom en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram; C h\u00e5ller tillbaka JA/AVSTAR och V h\u00e5ller tillbaka tolerans, s\u00e5 varken statsministeromr\u00f6stningen eller budgetmajoriteten \u00e4r s\u00e4krad. Den \u00f6nskade stabila S+C+MP-regeringen kan d\u00e4rf\u00f6r inte etableras p\u00e5 det angivna villkoret."}
2026-09-17 02:51:06,054 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "ab263087-0b09-4728-a8a2-7f27d0242f6f", "id": "37a3d91c-dfc4-4bd8-8628-613724fcb856", "reason": "The S+C+MP+V package is not a credible basis for a stable government: the joint working group has already failed to reconcile C's liberal-economy/school/decentralization demands with V's welfare/equality demands and MP's binding climate commitments within one financial framework (C withholds JA, V withholds tolerance), so the PM vote and budget majority are not secured; and V demands government participation if its mandates are needed, making its tolerance unreliable."}
2026-09-17 02:51:06,054 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "l", "argument_id": "ab263087-0b09-4728-a8a2-7f27d0242f6f", "id": "cf742839-09cf-46c9-84c7-4e67b39f1925", "reason": "C's own liberal-economy/school/decentralisation demands cannot be reconciled with V's welfare/equality/reduced-profit-seeking demands and MP's binding climate commitments within a single credible fiscal framework: the joint working group has already failed to finalise such a package (C withholds JA/AVSTAR and V withholds tolerance), so the conditional S+C+MP+V package cannot be completed and the PM vote and budget majority remain unsecured."}
2026-09-17 02:51:06,054 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "sd", "argument_id": "ab263087-0b09-4728-a8a2-7f27d0242f6f", "id": "e11cd8de-b9cd-49d3-9e6e-2b89562fcad4", "reason": "Den \u00f6nskade effekten f\u00f6ruts\u00e4tter att arbetsgruppen faktiskt f\u00f6renar C:s liberala krav (f\u00f6retagande, decentralisering, skola, liberal ekonomi) med V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/j\u00e4mlikhetskrav och MP:s bindande klimat\u00e5taganden i en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram \u2014 men arbetsgruppen har redan misslyckats med just denna f\u00f6rening (effekt 5fc537a4), och C driver samtidigt ett eget mittenalternativ (S-C-KD-MP=169) som inte ensamt n\u00e5r 175 och har inte l\u00f6st sin r\u00f6st. V h\u00e5ller inne tolerans utan bindande \u00e5taganden, och C:s krav st\u00e5r i direkt konflikt med V:s. D\u00e4rf\u00f6r \u00e4r varken statsministeromr\u00f6stningen eller budgetmajoriteten s\u00e4krad, och en stabil S+C+MP-regering med V som toleransparti etableras inte."}
