2026-09-17 02:55:22,888 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:55:22.765473", "id": "e5d81390-522f-44cc-8bcf-09460ac8ba64", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "Centerpartiet: Kristdemokraterna vill se dig i en borgerlig regering. M+C+KD+L med M som statsminister, SD som toleransparti (inte i regeringen) och V utanf\u00f6r uppfyller din r\u00f6da linje att SD inte ska sitta i regering. Det S+C+MP+V-alternativ du driver har misslyckats tv\u00e5 g\u00e5nger att f\u00f6rena C:s liberala krav med V:s och MP:s krav inom en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram - det \u00e4r inte trov\u00e4rdigt och skulle l\u00e4mna KD helt utanf\u00f6r. G\u00e5 med i M+C+KD+L s\u00e5 s\u00e4krar vi borgerlig styrning och tydligt sakpolitiskt inflytande f\u00f6r b\u00e5de KD och C. Vilka konkreta villkor beh\u00f6ver du f\u00f6r att g\u00e5 med?", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:55:22,888 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:55:22.777390", "id": "2b6197f4-cfe7-47a8-8c9b-fc34eb272796", "public": false, "recipients": ["m", "l"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "KD st\u00e5r fast bakom M+C+KD+L med M som statsminister, SD som tolerans (inte i regeringen) och V utanf\u00f6r. Vi koordinerar nu f\u00f6r att f\u00e5 C att g\u00e5 med. Bekr\u00e4fta att ni st\u00e5r bakom denna linje och en trov\u00e4rdig gemensam budgetv\u00e4g s\u00e5 att vi kan presentera ett enat borgerligt alternativ.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:55:22,888 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T00:55:22.786387", "id": "b7d23619-4ac1-460c-aa65-d78ee2617e72", "public": false, "recipients": ["sd"], "sender_actor_id": "kd", "text": "KD noterar ert toleranserbjudande f\u00f6r en M+C+KD+L-regering. Vi beh\u00f6ver verifiera att era bindande garantier (migration/s\u00e4kerhet/v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd) \u00e4r f\u00f6renliga med KD:s egen profil och att ni tolererar utan att kr\u00e4va regeringsdeltagande. Bekr\u00e4fta toleransrollen och era villkor s\u00e5 att vi kan f\u00f6rankra paketet med C.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 02:55:22,888 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "KD formally commits to and actively builds the M+C+KD+L government with M as statsminister, SD as toleransparti (inte i regeringen), V utanf\u00f6r regeringen, and publicly presses C to join, offering C and KD clear verifiable sakpolitiskt inflytande within the package.", "actor_id": "kd", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A credible M+C+KD+L borgerlig regeringspaket is consolidated with M as PM, C in government, SD as tolerance party (not in government), V out of government, passing the 175-nej-testet deterministically (nej = S+V+MP = 151 < 175) with a credible budget path.", "id": "a6a9bec7-59ab-4e82-b88c-112cfc5c587c", "pros": ["Satisfies C's red line (no SD in government) because SD is only a tolerance party, not in the government.", "Keeps V out of government, KD's core red line, while keeping M as PM and the borgerlig path alive.", "Passes the 175-nej-testet deterministically: only S+V+MP (151) would vote no, below 175.", "The competing S+C+MP+V package is not credible: the working group has failed twice to reconcile C's liberal demands with V's and MP's within one fiscal framework (C withholds JA, V withholds tolerance).", "Gives KD and C clear, verifiable policy influence in a functioning government rather than leaving KD out entirely."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
