2026-09-17 02:57:36,852 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "v", "argument_id": "a6a9bec7-59ab-4e82-b88c-112cfc5c587c", "id": "499ac54a-e3b8-44fa-84a4-5507fa7a50d2", "reason": "KD:s \u00f6nskade effekt f\u00f6ruts\u00e4tter att C ing\u00e5r i en M+C+KD+L-regering med SD som toleransparti, men C har uttryckligen v\u00e4grat att ing\u00e5 i en regering som ger SD bindande inflytande och har i st\u00e4llet bekr\u00e4ftat ett villkorat JA till S:s statsministerkandidat i en S+C+MP-regering med V som toleransparti. SD har dessutom upprepat v\u00e4grat en passiv toleransroll utanf\u00f6r regeringen och kr\u00e4ver antingen regeringsdeltagande eller opposition. Utan C:s deltagande och SD:s tolerans kan paketet inte konsolideras och 175-nej-testet kan inte passeras deterministiskt som p\u00e5st\u00e5tt."}
2026-09-17 02:57:36,853 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "s", "argument_id": "a6a9bec7-59ab-4e82-b88c-112cfc5c587c", "id": "81ba15c9-5685-47b8-9d71-8cc1e91601ee", "reason": "C's confirmed explicit JA for S's PM candidate and its firm red line against any SD binding influence mean C will not join an M-led government that offers SD binding influence over profile issues and budget path (C left Tido over exactly this). Without C in the government, C would vote NEJ, making the no-vote S+C+V+MP=176, above the 175 threshold, so the M+C+KD+L package cannot pass the 175-nej-testet and the desired effect fails."}
2026-09-17 02:57:36,853 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "c", "argument_id": "a6a9bec7-59ab-4e82-b88c-112cfc5c587c", "id": "c40db1a8-801e-4ff5-b58d-01ce63cc27b1", "reason": "C has firmly and repeatedly declined the M+C+KD+L path with SD as tolerance party as Tid\u00f6-aligned and contrary to C's mitten preference and credibility. SD's tolerance is explicitly conditional on binding, verifiable guarantees for SD's profile issues and a verifiable fiscal framework with binding influence mechanisms, which would give SD binding influence over the budget path and profile issues - precisely what C's red line forbids. Since C will not join, the M+C+KD+L package cannot be consolidated with C in government, so the desired effect fails."}
2026-09-17 02:57:36,853 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "mp", "argument_id": "a6a9bec7-59ab-4e82-b88c-112cfc5c587c", "id": "f2365537-20ed-456b-bddd-7c32957fdb92", "reason": "C has already formally confirmed an explicit conditional JA for S's PM candidate in an S+C+MP government with V as tolerance party, accepted the red-green demand list as negotiation basis, and confirmed it will not vote NEJ against S's PM candidate; C's public red line is against SD influence. The KD argument's desired effect requires C to join an M-led government with SD as tolerance party giving SD binding, verifiable influence over profile issues and budget \u2014 a premise directly contradicted by C's confirmed commitment and red line. C will therefore not join, so the M+C+KD+L package cannot be consolidated as described and the desired effect (C in government, package secured) fails."}
