2026-09-17 03:00:19,847 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T01:00:19.695389", "id": "924235b4-f353-4756-93f6-f84d03d3f31b", "public": false, "recipients": ["s", "c"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "MP is ready to finalize. We present concrete, binding, verifiable climate/environment commitments \u2014 strengthened emission targets, a fair green transition, nature restoration, phase-out of fossil subsidies \u2014 within a credible fiscal framework. We urge S and C to join us in finalizing the verifiable reform/budget package that meets V's prioritized core demands, so V's abstention and budget support hold and we secure the S+MP+C government with V as tolerance party. This is the only way to keep L/M/KD/SD out of government and deny M's SD-tolerance alternative a majority.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 03:00:19,847 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T01:00:19.707806", "id": "dc452332-fcb8-4603-a656-2ef0d77706ec", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "MP fully supports your prioritized, flexible demand list and confirms our climate commitments remain binding and verifiable. We will work to ensure your core demands \u2014 welfare, housing, equality, reduced profit-seeking \u2014 are met within a credible fiscal framework. Your AVST\u00c5R and budget support are decisive for securing the S+MP+C government with you as tolerance party; we count on them holding once the package is concrete and verifiable.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 03:00:19,847 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "MP formally presents to the C+S+MP working group a concrete, binding, verifiable climate/environment reform package \u2014 strengthened binding emission-reduction targets, a fair green transition with social compensation, nature restoration, and phase-out of fossil subsidies \u2014 within a credible fiscal framework, and commits to finalize the S+MP+C government with V as tolerance party by meeting V's prioritized core demands.", "actor_id": "mp", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The C+S+MP working group finalizes a concrete, verifiable reform/budget package with binding climate commitments and a credible budget path that meets V's prioritized core demands, so V's AVST\u00c5R (not NO) and budget support hold, the S+MP+C government with V as tolerance is secured (Tid\u00f6=173 < 175 NO), and the M+C+KD+L+SD-tolerance alternative is denied a majority.", "id": "9a5a4552-173e-4910-a6f7-35fc804e22a0", "pros": ["MP's binding, verifiable climate commitments give C the concrete content it needs to defend participation and convert its conditional JA into a firm JA for S's PM candidate.", "Meeting V's prioritized core demands (welfare, housing, equality, reduced profit-seeking) within a credible fiscal framework secures V's AVST\u00c5R and budget support, keeping the 175-nej test below 175 (Tid\u00f6=173).", "A concrete, verifiable package breaks the deadlock M is exploiting, denying M the opening for an M+C+KD+L government with SD tolerance.", "MP's flexibility on secondary issues (per V's prioritized approach) allows reconciliation of C's liberal demands with V's welfare demands within one financial framework.", "This secures MP's core objective: binding, visible climate/environment wins in the government solution while keeping L/M/KD/SD out of government."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
