2026-09-17 03:02:37,221 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "9a5a4552-173e-4910-a6f7-35fc804e22a0", "id": "8366f1a2-4282-49a2-8a7c-cfce7799eeba", "reason": "MP's binding, verifiable climate commitments add further fiscal demands to a working group that has already failed twice to reconcile C's liberal-economy/school/decentralization demands with V's welfare/equality demands and MP's climate commitments within a single credible fiscal framework. Adding more binding commitments makes reconciliation harder, not easier: C still withholds its JA and V still withholds tolerance, so the PM vote and budget majority remain unsecured and the S+MP+C+V package stays non-credible. Moreover, this package would put V in a tolerance role and leave KD entirely outside, contrary to KD's Tid\u00f6-first priority and its red line that V stays out of government."}
2026-09-17 03:02:37,221 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "l", "argument_id": "9a5a4552-173e-4910-a6f7-35fc804e22a0", "id": "99a29e1f-9929-4b7d-b5a7-12e851623bc4", "reason": "MP's binding climate commitments and V's prioritized welfare/equality/reduced-profit-seeking demands remain irreconcilable with C's liberal-economy/school/decentralization demands within a single credible fiscal framework: the C+S+MP working group has already failed to reconcile them (effects 5fc537a4, 38a38dac), and MP's package only restates V's demands without resolving the core conflict. C therefore cannot convert its conditional JA into a firm JA for S's PM, so the concrete verifiable package, V's AVST\u00c5R/budget support, and the 175-nej test are not secured and the S+MP+C+V government is not established."}
2026-09-17 03:02:37,222 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "sd", "argument_id": "9a5a4552-173e-4910-a6f7-35fc804e22a0", "id": "ffbfe9f4-23a3-4de5-9c18-d7095288d8c3", "reason": "MP:s bindande klimatpaket (sk\u00e4rpta utsl\u00e4ppsm\u00e5l, naturrestaurering, avveckling av fossila subventioner) l\u00e4gger till kostsamma, icke-f\u00f6rhandlingsbara \u00e5taganden som C+S+MP-arbetsgruppen redan upprepade g\u00e5nger misslyckats med att f\u00f6rena med C:s liberala ekonomi-/skol-/decentraliseringskrav och V:s v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-/j\u00e4mlikhetskrav inom en trov\u00e4rdig finanspolitisk ram (effekter 5fc537a4, 38a38dac). C:s villkorade JA \u00e4r uttryckligen avh\u00e4ngigt att just detta konkreta verifierbara paket f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4lls, vilket inte har skett; C driver dessutom fortfarande sitt eget mittenalternativ och har inte l\u00f6st sin r\u00f6st. D\u00e4rf\u00f6r kommer paketet inte att f\u00e4rdigst\u00e4llas, V:s AVST\u00c5R och budgetst\u00f6d h\u00e5ller inte, och S+MP+C-regeringen med V som toleransparti s\u00e4kras inte \u2014 175-nej-testet och budgetmajoriteten f\u00f6rblir os\u00e4krade, vilket l\u00e4mnar d\u00f6rren \u00f6ppen f\u00f6r M+C+KD+L+SD-toleransalternativet."}
